<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
    <title>Certificate verification · Chamilo</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            color: #18324d;
            background: #f4f7fb;
        }
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin: 0; min-width: 320px; line-height: 1.5; }
        a { color: #0e5d93; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
        a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #f3a528; outline-offset: 4px; border-radius: 3px; }
        .site-header { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e1e9ef; }
        .shell { width: min(100% - 40px, 900px); margin: 0 auto; }
        .site-header .shell { min-height: 76px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
        .brand-symbol { display: grid; width: 40px; height: 40px; place-items: center; border-radius: 11px; background: #0f3658; color: #fff; }
        .brand-symbol svg { width: 25px; height: 25px; }
        .brand-name { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.035em; color: #0d3559; }
        .brand-rule { width: 1px; height: 22px; margin: 0 3px; background: #d5e0e9; }
        .brand-label { font-size: .82rem; color: #63768a; font-weight: 600; }
        main { padding: 58px 0 70px; }
        .intro { margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .eyebrow { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; font-size: .73rem; letter-spacing: .15em; color: #466a86; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; }
        .eyebrow::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 23px; height: 3px; border-radius: 3px; background: #f2a426; }
        h1 { margin: 14px 0 8px; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.7rem); letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1.15; color: #102c46; }
        .lead { margin: 0; max-width: 660px; color: #63758a; font-size: .97rem; }
        .panel { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dce5ed; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 14px 45px rgba(15, 44, 72, .07); }
        .panel-top { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px 18px; padding: 18px 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ebf0f4; color: #60758a; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .045em; }
        .panel-top strong { color: #294762; }
        .verdict { display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 30px 28px 28px; }
        .verdict-icon { width: 56px; height: 56px; flex: 0 0 56px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 16px; }
        .verdict-icon svg { width: 30px; height: 30px; }
        .tone-valid { background: #e6f6ed; color: #187344; }
        .tone-danger { background: #fbe9e9; color: #a32f36; }
        .tone-warning { background: #fff2d9; color: #935e0a; }
        .tone-neutral { background: #ebf0f5; color: #4c6276; }
        .verdict-caption { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #657b90; text-transform: uppercase; }
        h2 { margin: 4px 0 8px; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.8rem); letter-spacing: -.035em; line-height: 1.22; }
        .verdict p { color: #597085; font-size: .9rem; margin: 0; max-width: 610px; }
        .tone-text-valid { color: #187344; }
        .tone-text-danger { color: #a32f36; }
        .tone-text-warning { color: #935e0a; }
        .tone-text-neutral { color: #4c6276; }
        .section { border-top: 1px solid #ecf0f4; padding: 23px 28px; }
        .section h3 { margin: 0 0 18px; color: #253f57; font-size: .92rem; font-weight: 800; }
        .details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 22px 26px; margin: 0; }
        .details > div { min-width: 0; }
        dt { margin-bottom: 5px; color: #697e90; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .065em; }
        dd { margin: 0; color: #153653; font-size: .96rem; font-weight: 650; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
        .status-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
        .status-item { padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #e5ebf1; border-radius: 11px; background: #f9fbfd; }
        .status-item strong { display: flex; gap: 7px; align-items: center; font-size: .88rem; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #90a2b2; flex: 0 0 8px; }
        .dot-valid { background: #229860; }
        .dot-warning { background: #e5a32f; }
        .dot-danger { background: #c85157; }
        .status-item p { margin: 0; color: #6b7c8e; font-size: .8rem; }
        .anchor-link { display: inline-flex; margin-top: 10px; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 650; }
        .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #ecf0f4; padding: 22px 28px; }
        .action-back { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 15px; border: 1px solid #cfdae5; border-radius: 9px; color: #234866; background: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 700; }
        .action-back:hover { background: #f4f8fb; }
        .action-back svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
        /* Symfony injects its dev toolbar, but this public page intentionally blocks its JS via CSP. */
        /* Hide only the broken dev-toolbar placeholder on this standalone verification view. */
        [id^="sfwdt"], .sf-toolbar { display: none !important; }
        .action-download { display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; padding: 11px 16px; background: #103a60; border-radius: 9px; color: #fff; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
        .action-download:hover { background: #195782; }
        .action-download svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
        .actions-note { color: #7c8b9c; font-size: .76rem; }
        .footnote { max-width: 800px; margin: 23px 0 0; color: #718295; font-size: .79rem; line-height: 1.7; }
        @media (max-width: 620px) {
            .shell { width: min(100% - 28px, 900px); }
            .site-header .shell { min-height: 65px; }
            .brand-label { font-size: .73rem; }
            main { padding: 35px 0 52px; }
            .panel-top, .verdict, .section, .actions { padding-left: 19px; padding-right: 19px; }
            .verdict { gap: 12px; }
            .verdict-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; flex-basis: 44px; border-radius: 12px; }
            .verdict-icon svg { width: 25px; height: 25px; }
            .details, .status-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
            .action-download { transition: background-color .18s ease; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="site-header">
    <div class="shell">
        <span class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M12 2.5 20 6v5.9c0 5-3.1 8.1-8 10.1-4.9-2-8-5.1-8-10.1V6l8-3.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="m8.2 12 2.3 2.4 5.4-5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="brand-name">Chamilo</span>
        <span class="brand-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="brand-label">Credential verification</span>
    </div>
</header>
<main class="shell">
    <div class="intro">
        <div class="eyebrow">Certificate authenticity</div>
        <h1>Certificate verification</h1>
        <p class="lead">Check the issuer signature, certificate integrity and current validity. Blockchain anchoring is an optional, separate proof.</p>
    </div>

    <article class="panel" aria-labelledby="verification-result">
        <div class="panel-top">
            <strong>VERIFICATION RESULT</strong>
            <span>Ed25519 · Chamilo Certificate Credential v1</span>
        </div>
        <div class="verdict">
            <span class="verdict-icon tone-{{ statusTone }}" aria-hidden="true">
                {% if valid %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="m5 12.5 4.4 4.4L19 7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                {% else %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M12 7v6m0 3.4v.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                        <path d="M12 2.7 22 20H2L12 2.7Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                {% endif %}
            </span>
            <div>
                <div class="verdict-caption">Current verification status</div>
                <h2 id="verification-result" class="tone-text-{{ statusTone }}">{{ statusLabel }}</h2>
                {% if valid %}
                    <p>This signed credential is currently valid. Its signature, original certificate and the holder's publication consent have been checked.</p>
                {% else %}
                    <p>This credential cannot currently be verified as valid. Personal certificate details are not displayed.</p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>

        {% if valid and credential is iterable %}
            <div class="section">
                <h3>Certificate details</h3>
                <dl class="details">
                    <div><dt>Certificate holder</dt><dd>{{ credential.subject|default('—') }}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Course</dt><dd>{{ credential.course|default('—') }}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Issued on</dt><dd>{{ credential.issuedAt|default('—') }}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Issuer format</dt><dd>Chamilo Certificate Credential v1</dd></div>
                </dl>
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if hasSignature %}
            <div class="section">
                <h3>Verification checks</h3>
                <div class="status-row">
                    <div class="status-item">
                        <strong><span class="dot {{ signatureValid ? 'dot-valid' : 'dot-danger' }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>Digital signature</strong>
                        <p>{{ signatureValid ? 'Ed25519 signature verified' : 'Signature could not be verified' }}</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status-item">
                        <strong>
                            <span class="dot {{ explorerUrl ? 'dot-valid' : 'dot-warning' }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            Sepolia blockchain
                        </strong>
                        {% if explorerUrl %}
                            <p>Previously confirmed on Sepolia. The chain is not rechecked continuously on this page.</p>
                            <a class="anchor-link" href="{{ explorerUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">View Sepolia transaction ↗</a>
                        {% else %}
                            <p>Not anchored — the digital signature can be verified without a blockchain transaction.</p>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="actions">
            <a class="action-back" href="{{ backUrl }}">
                <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="m14.5 5-7 7 7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                {{ backLabel }}
            </a>
            <a class="action-download" href="{{ jsonUrl }}" rel="nofollow" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
                <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M12 3v12m-4-4 4 4 4-4M4 17v3h16v-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Download verification JSON
            </a>
            <span class="actions-note">No account is required to view this verification result.</span>
        </div>
    </article>

    <p class="footnote">
        Chamilo Certificate Credential v1 is a Chamilo-specific signed format, not a W3C Verifiable Credential.
        A previously confirmed blockchain transaction does not override expiry, revocation or consent withdrawal.
        Independent offline verification requires an exported credential and a separately trusted issuer public key.
    </p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
